  <entry>
    <title>为什么 MySQL 更新主键是大忌，而 PG/Oracle 却很轻松？</title>
    <link href="https://aqiu16717.github.io/2026/05/08/update-primary-key-mysql-vs-pg/"/>
    <id>https://aqiu16717.github.io/2026/05/08/update-primary-key-mysql-vs-pg/</id>
